Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my struggles\Nshoot me through the sky It'd be a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,if we lingered here And let our pretty\Nsparks of life flindle out and disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even\Nyou can't navigate If someone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.24,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,strong like you is lost then\Nwho will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause when the waves cast,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,my heart adrift It's been your\Nkindness and your strength
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That would free me from\Nthe mist And just like that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on Sail to a\Nnew dawn Weigh anchor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,ride as high as you can I assure,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need anger I go fast as I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah I hear you laughing like you're numb\Nto it all While we're dashing together No,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we're never gonna fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.82,0:00:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the whole world may\Nnow be my enemy. Water swirl,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but I ain't backing\Ndown so long as I'm free
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought I'll give it, come ride\Nthe current with me. All in,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.52,0:01:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,wake up bright and early,\Nmaking for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A short time ago, before\NLuffy's departure,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.66,0:01:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,he made a visit to the\Nruins of Odin Castle where
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.80,0:01:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the graves of Kozuki Odin\Nand his allies once were.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,However, thanks to Kaido's blast breath,\Nthere was nothing left but destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.70,0:02:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Years ago, Odin built his first castle\Nthere when he became the Daimyo of Kuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the Daimyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.26,0:02:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.56,0:02:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Luffy Toto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.46,0:02:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are all of you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to tell Lord Odin\Nthat we won the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been rather eventful since we've\Nbeen away, so there's much to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bigger question is, why\Nare you, Gaara, here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.00,0:02:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,To see Odin, same as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ka-ba-ba-ba-ba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You two would have been\Ngood friends, I'm certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He would be honored to meet the man\Nwho saved his country from Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Odin, thanks to Sir Lufitaro and his\Nfriends, we defeated Orochi and Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,At long last, the land of Wano is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.14,0:03:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Lord Momonosuke, he\Nhas become a beloved Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,With us beside him, he will make this\Ncountry a land of peace as it was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your people will smile again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I only wish that Ashura\Nand Iza were here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll always be here, for we\Nwill carry them in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.56,0:04:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,just as we do with Lord Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.90,0:04:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well spoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're having their own banquet,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.24,0:04:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and they'll feast again when we join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to keel over yet, but I can't\Nwait to have our Lord's Oden when I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.62,0:04:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't forgotten the\Nflavor, and how could
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,i it's the flavor of\Nour friendship it tasted
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.80,0:04:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,even better after training we ate and ate
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,that sounds nice wish i\Ncould try some too yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,me too you guys know\Nthe recipe we can have
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji cook up a pot we\Nshould stock up on some
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,ingredients to take on\Nthe sunny yeah go for
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.58,0:04:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,it and get as much as\Nyou can carry sir luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be leaving soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.78,0:04:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,With all our hearts, once\Nagain, we must thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We owe you our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're friends, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Carrot?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You, Chia, can't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.16,0:05:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to stay with you, Chia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kara, what's wrong? Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.88,0:05:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to Zou.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to protect my homeland\Nwith Wanda and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyagi, Tristan, thank\Nyou for all your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.74,0:05:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Gaara, for teaching me\Nso much as a doctor and as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't work too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get good sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, I'm reminded of the first time we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,As I recall, Carrot, you\Nstowed away on the sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems your dream to see the\Nocean came true in a big way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.52,0:06:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it all you hoped for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all about it more!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.06,0:06:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw crazy islands and went on big\Nadventures and made amazing friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It was scary sometimes, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think I came out of it\Na lot stronger than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.30,0:06:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe it all to you, Tia. So, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.80,0:06:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll treasure these memories\Nfor the rest of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one last thing\Nfor us to do! Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I had so much fun spending time\Nwith you, Tia Nami, my Beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.92,0:06:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, I miss you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't forget my child, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That tickled carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.80,0:06:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I got to be your bro! Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, when I was coming out here,\NI saw Zoro. Yeah? Where was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.36,0:07:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's share a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Having a few drinks with\Nyour old man, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pour one for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.42,0:07:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.56,0:07:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you put these flowers here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.84,0:07:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sis helped me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It was her idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, Juro, you came to pay\Nyour respects as well? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,May you rest in peace, Lord Yasui.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll build you a nice\Ntemple soon, promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll come and visit\Nyou all the time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never be lonely with\Nme around, Dad. Right? Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.98,0:08:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you came here to say farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.60,0:08:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you'll be leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That the time has come?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.22,0:08:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I will certainly miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only you, I will also have to bid\Nfarewell to my father's beloved Enma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't have it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He still holds a grip on the blade\Nthat slices through the deepest hells.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin was one hell of a swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,the sword is a beast it\Nwould take a true master
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.74,0:09:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to tame it it sounds\Nlike you're being modest
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you saved the land of wano\Nby wielding that sword
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,yourself you're a master\Njust like my father was
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,no i'm still not good enough\Ndon't say that it looks to me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Like Enma is rejoicing. It's\Npleased to have a partner like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.84,0:10:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.70,0:10:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You trying to pull one over\Non me, you cheeky brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me there's something\Nwrong with my repair work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're damn right there is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.75,0:10:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you need to get your eyes\Nchecked, you useless old fart bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.96,0:10:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who asked me to double-check\Nyour repairs, you cocky little turd!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.16,0:10:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't start pissing on me because I did you\Na favor, even if it was a waste of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But you knew that already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You little punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you could've left me\Na spot to fix as a courtesy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.10,0:10:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I climbed up here just\Nto look like a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry you can't handle\Nmy super repair work!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the shipwright\Nof the crew, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.56,0:10:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats wouldn't have made\Nit this far if you weren't a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:11:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, you damn oversized blockhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta miss your big fat mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.44,0:11:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll miss you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.24,0:11:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything okay back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies, sir. One\Nmoment. I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your patience. No prop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.52,0:11:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, regarding your color, it's blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you'll look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Usohachi, you're so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the most handsome man in all of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me a smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, young madam,\Nanything for a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.62,0:11:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.18,0:11:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, that's not what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.98,0:11:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha, you want a little more flair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.36,0:11:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got just the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.26,0:11:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you'll turn some heads with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Usohachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.78,0:11:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lady Killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone\Nwear that color so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.24,0:11:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's red-hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.86,0:11:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful not to fall in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.72,0:11:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.63,0:11:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop distracting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.55,0:12:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need plain black fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.06,0:12:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need lots\Nand lots, though, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's so terribly plain, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A gentleman like you deserves much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.14,0:12:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.85,0:12:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall provide you with the finest\Nthat Wano has to offer, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.74,0:12:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, buddy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Good I think that's enough for today
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.56,0:12:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the lesson
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanguro's special soba is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.74,0:12:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never get enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.06,0:12:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.72,0:12:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.24,0:12:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.84,0:12:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.36,0:12:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I like to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.14,0:12:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Choo-chee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.10,0:13:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you want a pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.18,0:13:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What a cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.40,0:13:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.84,0:13:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up? You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.89,0:13:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I just realized I never thanked\Nyou for everything you did
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,For me, you saved my life at\NOnigashima. Don't mention it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.56,0:13:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my pleasure to help you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you sell me your soba tomorrow, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And the next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and the day after that I\Nfeel like it gives me the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,power to do my best You really\Nknow how to flatter a guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I'm leaving soon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.66,0:13:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Already, but I
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,excuse me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.46,0:13:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,i don't suppose you could spare a\Nbowl for me anytime robin thanks for
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:14:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,stopping by and make it a hot one if you\Nwould please yes ma 'am coming right up
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.22,0:14:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and can i have one too huh yeah fine hey
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're working so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.42,0:14:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I brought you a little snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.38,0:14:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you've all earned a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.54,0:14:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best. Thanks\Na bunch. Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That smells great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And it tastes even better, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait, I've been so\Nbusy. I understand. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.20,0:14:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet it'll be worth the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure was!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.88,0:15:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your red bean soup's the best\Nthing in the world, Otsudu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, there's rice cakes too! Mm-hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm! Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.93,0:15:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Lamo is so soft and chewy! Eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.74,0:15:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have as many bowls as you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.30,0:15:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomo, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.14,0:15:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I'm having fun, I\Nremembered you're gonna leave soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.46,0:15:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, I got a lump in my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,First, Ace. Then you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All the people I love leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.34,0:16:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And after what happened to Ace, I'm\Nafraid I'll never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me rice when you\Nbarely had any for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.42,0:16:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.36,0:16:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll all be in my heart\Nno matter where you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Train hard while I'm gone! I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.02,0:16:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, we'll meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.14,0:16:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:16:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, big friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.76,0:17:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get real strong! You'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be a hero like you and Abe someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, we return to the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.28,0:17:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.90,0:17:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We can set sail whenever you're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.78,0:17:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you really sure you\Nwant to leave like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't say goodbye\Nto Momo or to Kinamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems kind of wrong after all\Nwe've been through with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.04,0:17:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.14,0:17:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.05,0:17:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If Luffy wants to go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.88,0:17:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you gotta be such a bastard, Mosshead?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.18,0:17:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw off, curly brows. Hey! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.62,0:17:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Although,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.53,0:17:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,it is a bit of a shame since\Nwe shared so many adventures
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.06,0:17:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,with those two even before\Nwe came to the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.02,0:17:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It does feel a bit cold to\Nsilently sail away like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Luffy, you can make the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.32,0:18:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be here soon.
